                  "blocks": {
                    "content": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>Material:</strong> 100% polyester.</p><p><strong>Care instructions:</strong></p><ul><li>Hand wash only.</li><li>Wash separately.</li><li>Do not bleach.</li><li>Dry in shade.</li><li>Do not tumble dry.</li><li>Iron on a low setting.</li><li>Do not dry clean.</li></ul><p>Always follow the care label on your garment.</p>",
