                        "text": "<p><strong>For this personalized tee</strong></p><p>Personalized and made-to-order items are excluded from change-of-mind returns. Your rights for damaged, defective or incorrect items remain protected.</p><p><strong>30-day money-back guarantee: eligible non-personalized items only</strong></p><p>For eligible standard items, contact us within 30 calendar days of delivery. Items must be unused, unworn and unwashed, with original tags and packaging, and in resalable condition. Customers pay return shipping for change-of-mind returns.</p><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:info@zena-c.com\">info@zena-c.com</a> for approval and return instructions before sending your item back.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/refund-policy\">View full return policy</a></p>",
